  "summary": "Luke Adams is a polarizing Milwaukee Brewers prospect known for his unconventional, pull-heavy swing and exceptional on-base skills, driven by extreme patience at the plate and a high rate of getting hit by pitches. He possesses plus raw power but his swing can lead to a high pop-up rate. Adams is projected to move from third base to first base due to limited defensive range, clunky feet, and an average arm.",
